# Source: https://github.com/arq5x/bedtools2/issues/998
#   https://github.com/arq5x/bedtools2/issues/235
# Symptom: GFF3 file used as BED input; GFF3 has 9 columns with a different
#   semantic layout (col 1=seqid, col 4=start [1-based], col 5=end, col 7=strand);
#   bedtools complement receives "KN805525.1" in col 1 (ok) but "ensembl" in
#   col 2 (not an integer start coordinate) and the attribute string in col 9.
#   Distinct from gff_as_bed.bed (already in corpus); this is the GFF3 variant
#   with full attribute strings in col 9.
KN805525.1	ensembl	exon	2500	2651	.	-	.	gene_id "ENSFHEG00000014345"; gene_name "cdx1a"
KN805525.1	ensembl	CDS	3000	3200	.	-	.	gene_id "ENSFHEG00000014345"; gene_name "cdx1a"
